ABSD substantial adaptation of sbase0.1 tar (MIT; userland/sbase.LICENSE).
Controller source choice explicitly authorizes replacing record validation,
I/O, effect ordering and directory-fd traversal. This is not a smallpatch
or a claim that the original parser/extractor remains unchanged.
Preserves uncompressed ustar create/list/extract and file/directory contents.
Native metadata and stable-pathname policy: userland/README.md, tar section.
No new POSIX API; unsupported compression/extensions/types/options refuse.
Original sources staged by userland/PIN; tests userland/test_tar.py.

